  "title": "Oklahoma Cheese Grits",
  "description": "It&#39;s a great day when my mom serves up this Southern specialty! Cooked grits are combined with seasonings, cheese, and eggs, then baked. You may adjust or eliminate the hot sauce to suit your taste.",
  "authors": [
    "SARA LEE"
